<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wells Fargo estimates cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wells Fargo estimates cut.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brown Brothers Harriman and Co Ray Soifer reduced his 1997 estimate for Wells Fargo Co from $13.80 to $12.65 a share and 1998 estimate from $18.25 to $17.00.</p>
<p>--  Soifer cited conerns about continuing erosion of revenue, which is now running at normalized rate of about $1.765 billion and the slowing of the pace of expense reduction.</p>
</text>
